        "created_at": "2013-12-31T15:52:58.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Hopefully this counts as staying on topic, but as long as we're discussing the ridiculous amount of cards (around 1790 cards by the time Vengeance is out) does anyone have any good card sleeve suggestions?</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I have yet to sleeve any of my cards (since my current EE box is packed to the brim), but with my RC/IR box on the way and a third large box&nbsp;coming with&nbsp;Vengeance's release, I definitely want to start sleeving.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Obviously, penny sleeves would put me at around $18 + tax, but if those are too unreliable or flimsy or slippery (I've never been into trading card games, so I really don't have experience with sleeves), can anyone suggest some decent sleeves that are good enough quality without breaking my wallet in half?</p>",
        "post_number": 8,
